    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 8 Red Arches Close is a bright and stylish one-bedroom apartment situated on the third floor of this attractive and well-established development in Baldoyle.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 44.4 sq. m. and is presented in good condition throughout. A welcoming entrance hallway with timber flooring provides access to each room and includes a hot press and useful storage.\r\n\r\nThe impressive open-plan living and dining room is the centrepiece of the apartment. High ceilings, elevated glazing and a large picture window create an excellent sense of space while allowing natural light to fill the room. Timber flooring and an attractive outlook complement this comfortable living area, which offers ample space for both relaxing and dining.\r\n\r\nThe adjoining kitchen is fitted with contemporary pale-grey units, dark worktops and tiled flooring, together with a range of integrated and freestanding appliances. A window above the worktop brings additional natural light into the kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe generously proportioned double bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and extensive corner glazing, creating a bright and comfortable sleeping space. The accommodation is completed by a modern, fully tiled bathroom containing a bath with an overhead shower, wash-hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nRed Arches Close forms part of The Coast, a popular residential development convenient to Baldoyle Village, local shops, cafés and coastal amenities. Clongriffin DART Station is within easy reach, offering regular transport connections to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas. The property is also well served by bus routes and provides convenient access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nA good selection of schools, crèches and childcare facilities can be found throughout Baldoyle, Clongriffin and the surrounding neighbourhoods, making the area suitable for a wide range of buyers. Nearby coastal walks, landscaped green spaces and cycling routes provide excellent recreational opportunities.\r\n\r\nWith its light-filled interior, distinctive high ceilings and convenient location, No. 8 Red Arches Close represents an appealing opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a well-connected Dublin 13 property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•One designated parking space\r\n\r\n•Third-floor apartment\r\n\r\n•Approx. 44.4 sq. m. (478 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n•Bright open-plan living/dining room\r\n\r\n•High ceilings and excellent natural light\r\n\r\n•Modern fitted kitchen\r\n\r\n•Double bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\n•Fully tiled bathroom\r\n\r\n•Hot press and storage\r\n\r\n•Landscaped communal grounds\r\n\r\n•Close to Clongriffin DART Station\r\n\r\n•Convenient to schools, crèches and local amenities"
      },
